# agent-box — base egress allowlist.
#
# One DNS name per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# Each name is resolved to A records on every firewall run and the addresses
# are added to the `allowed-domains` ipset. Nothing else may leave the VM.
#
# This file is generic on purpose: it must stay committable to a public
# repository. Anything site-specific (an app under test, a staging host, an
# internal package mirror) belongs in allowlist.local, which lives on the host
# in ~/.config/agent-box/ and is never committed. See docs/decisions.md.
#
# GitHub is NOT listed here. Its address ranges are pulled from
# api.github.com/meta at runtime, which covers github.com, the API, raw
# content and the git endpoints in one go.

# --- Claude Code: model traffic -------------------------------------------
api.anthropic.com
claude.ai
platform.claude.com

# --- Claude Code: the native installer and self-update ---------------------
# claude.ai serves install.sh; downloads.claude.ai serves `latest`,
# manifest.json and the platform binary. Verified by reading install.sh
# (fetched 2026-09-04): DOWNLOAD_BASE_URL="https://downloads.claude.ai/claude-code-releases".
downloads.claude.ai

# --- Package registries the agent may need to install test dependencies ----
registry.npmjs.org
pypi.org
files.pythonhosted.org

# Deliberately NOT allowed, and disabled by DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1 and
# DISABLE_ERROR_REPORTING=1 in the guest environment instead:
#   sentry.io, statsig.com, statsig.anthropic.com
# Deliberately NOT allowed, because nothing in this VM is an editor:
#   marketplace.visualstudio.com, vscode.blob.core.windows.net,
#   update.code.visualstudio.com
